{"chapter": "properties", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "01PD", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$X$", "MATH_0002": "$X$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{A}$", "MATH_0004": "$\\mathcal{O}_X$", "MATH_0005": "$\\mathcal{A}$", "MATH_0006": "$\\mathcal{O}_X$", "MATH_0007": "$\\mathcal{A}$", "MATH_0008": "$\\mathcal{O}_X$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\item", "STRUCT_0003": "\\item", "STRUCT_0004": "\\end{enumerate}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-integral-algebra-directed-colimit-finite}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:511c3efcc599dcfa114f9a9aa8a4f1ca9a55146bfa6ff91833a9853af33bddde", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:4eecde9873c0e0c765a9066dd83c51e1f4c92f7a54a604add507948c57bbbb05", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a scheme. Assume <MATH_0002> is quasi-compact and quasi-separated.\nLet <MATH_0003> be an integral quasi-coherent <MATH_0004>-algebra.\nThen\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> <MATH_0005> is the directed colimit of its finite\nquasi-coherent <MATH_0006>-subalgebras, and\n<STRUCT_0003> <MATH_0007> is a direct colimit of finite and finitely\npresented quasi-coherent <MATH_0008>-algebras.\n<STRUCT_0004>\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:ca7c8fb5c887dce4fb554091d77b7cee0a986561214d8773ec65a34a15bff8e3", "unit_id": "tag:0817:statement"}
